Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.56,0:02:02.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master Teng Nine,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.88,0:02:04.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.80,0:02:06.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your challenger this time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.36,0:02:08.08,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1514,526)\fad(300,000)}Teng Yun\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.92,0:02:07.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,is Teng Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.38,0:02:14.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ancestor said
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:16.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,that prosperity lies
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.96,0:02:18.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,within the Core Family Members.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:19.60,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1524,498)\fad(300,000)}Teng Nine\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul\NTeng Family Core Member
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.24,0:02:21.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The position cannot be inherited.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:24.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Anyone in the Teng Family can compete for the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:27.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,The winner is determined
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:29.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,through a life or death duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,The spiritual energy of the Spirit Veins...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.44,0:02:36.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,All the pills and artifacts...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.16,0:02:39.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, I will become a Core Member
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.61,0:02:41.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,and take Teng Nine's position !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:44.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,He dares to keep his eyes closed ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:45.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,How arrogant !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:02.88,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1488,453)}Young Teng Nine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.28,0:03:12.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I admit defeat Brother, I admit defeat !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:20.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have already lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:21.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lost ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:23.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you're not dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.31,0:03:24.12,Second,,0,0,0,,I admit defeat !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.32,0:03:25.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I... I've already admitted defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.96,0:03:26.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Someone help me !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.16,0:03:36.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.04,0:03:38.96,TengNine,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1050,541)\fad(600,300)\t(\fs60)}Teng Nine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.36,0:03:40.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The name of Teng Nine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:42.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,has already been passed 6 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.24,0:03:48.48,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1509,550)}Teng Huayuan\NTeng Family Ancestor\NPeak Late stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.80,0:03:44.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:46.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,the younger generation gets stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:48.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Weaklings
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.83,0:03:50.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,should be discarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:54.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Nine is still inexperienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:58.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Out of the 9, he is the Core Family Member
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:04:00.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,with the weakest cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.76,0:04:03.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,He still reached Middle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:04.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Given enough time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.01,0:04:07.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,each of the 9 Nascent Souls
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:10.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,will have the potential to reach Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.24,0:04:14.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Given enough time ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.48,0:04:18.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your Teng Family
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:20.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,has 100 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:21.24,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1511,534)}Lin Yi\NHeaven’s Tower Envoy\NEarly stage Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.20,0:04:23.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,So far,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:26.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,no one has understood a domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.35,0:04:31.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's like sitting in a well, looking at the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.28,0:04:35.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,A domain is not something understood easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.68,0:04:39.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,without my ancestor's help,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.40,0:04:37.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even I,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.96,0:04:44.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,would have had trouble forming my Rain Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:50.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,In 100 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.72,0:04:53.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,if the Teng Family fails to produce a Soul Formation cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:56.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will take back everything I have given you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:04:58.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lord Envoy can rest assured,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.39,0:05:00.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Teng Family
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:02.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,will produce a Soul Formation cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:07.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Remember what you said today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.28,0:05:19.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:21.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,it should've been you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:23.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,With your talent,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.76,0:05:27.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,you would've reached Soul Formation by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.19,0:05:40.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those 9 Nascent Souls feed off the Spirit Veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:42.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I destroy those,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.25,0:05:44.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,they will appear before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:49.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are we going to destroy this Wufeng Valley ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.73,0:05:51.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can leave it to me !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.40,0:05:52.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will kill them !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.60,0:05:54.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master won't even have to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.32,0:05:58.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the country of Zhao, Wufeng Valley was the strongest sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.76,0:05:58.60,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1485,428)\fad(300,300)}Wufeng Valley
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:06:00.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:16.68,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1504,507)\fad(300,300)}Teng Shan\NTeng Family Core Disciple\NEarly stage Core formation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:18.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are so pathetic,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:20.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't you feel ashamed !?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.44,0:06:23.72,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1509,510)\fad(300,000)}Wu Hongming\NWufeng Valley Disciple\NLate stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:24.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're the Senior Brother of Wufeng Valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,the direct disciple of the Sect Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:27.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,You fight using Nascent Soul artifacts,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.78,0:06:29.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,what are you so proud of !?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.87,0:06:31.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,They fight for the position of Elder,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.28,0:06:33.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,he's supposed to display his own strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:34.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,not that of his borrowed Nascent Soul artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.84,0:06:37.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,What example for the disciples is this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:39.52,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1508,508)\fad(300,000)}Teng Gao\NWufeng Valley Elder\NLate stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:39.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every disciple of the Teng Family is given
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:41.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,their own Nascent Soul artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.56,0:06:43.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,This isn't borrowed strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:46.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,He is using his own weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:48.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,and he respects the Sect's rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.56,0:06:50.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised that even your best disciple
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.44,0:06:52.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,doesn't have a Nascent Soul artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.84,0:06:55.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I really don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:07:00.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just admit that you are a waste !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:02.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I never will !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:03.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's a shame !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.40,0:07:20.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bastard, fight me directly !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.60,0:07:40.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hongming !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:41.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.76,0:07:43.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Sect Leader hasn't announced the result yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:46.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Moving now is against the Sect's rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.60,0:07:49.84,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1581,492)\fad(300,300)}Wu Qingfeng\NWufeng Valley Sect Leader\NMiddle Stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:50.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wufeng Valley already lost 5 Elders,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.53,0:07:51.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is problematic...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.04,0:07:54.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Teng Family seized all the positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.24,0:07:57.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you think I don't know what you're doing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.76,0:08:01.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you are unsatisfied,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.52,0:08:04.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can discuss this with Teng Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.72,0:08:07.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am sure he is also very worried
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.35,0:08:09.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,about what is going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:14.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The winner is
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:16.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Shan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.60,0:08:19.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,He will now
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.20,0:08:21.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,hold the position of Elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.12,0:08:32.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's happening !?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.68,0:08:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,The formation is being attacked ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.12,0:08:34.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hold on !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.80,0:08:37.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sect Leader !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.52,0:08:40.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Someone broke through the first defensive layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:00.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't move !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.16,0:09:02.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Calm down !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:03.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keep the formation up !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.17,0:09:07.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wufeng Valley...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:10.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,It indeed used to be the top sect of Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.84,0:09:12.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The power of this formation
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.84,0:09:15.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,is at the peak of Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.72,0:09:26.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have heard of the strength of Wufeng Valley's formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.29,0:09:27.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seeing it with my own eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.64,0:09:29.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,is extraordinary !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.56,0:09:30.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Magnificent !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.04,0:09:32.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will soon be
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.32,0:09:35.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,the best formation of our Teng Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.80,0:09:53.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,This formation is very strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.72,0:09:55.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's derived from a restriction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.52,0:09:58.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since this formation uses sword energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.42,0:10:01.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will beat it with sword energy !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.76,0:10:04.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,10 000 Swords Restriction,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.37,0:10:04.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,activate !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:26.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come at me !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.04,0:10:32.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:50.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,What cultivation is he at ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.83,0:10:48.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,He beat it in one move ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.73,0:10:52.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wufeng Valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:55.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,doesn't know how it offended fellow cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:10:56.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,I came here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.80,0:10:58.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,to kill everyone named Teng.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:04.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whether I become enemy of Wufeng Valley
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.04,0:11:06.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,depends on your attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:08.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,You !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:11.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,You destroyed our Spirit Vein of the Tiandao Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:13.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you killed Teng Xuan !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.48,0:11:14.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who is Teng Xuan ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.49,0:11:16.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The names of your family
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.64,0:11:19.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,are not worth remembering.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:20.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not worth remembering !?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.60,0:11:21.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you !?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:33.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wufeng Valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.21,0:11:36.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,once the top sect of Zhao
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.96,0:11:39.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its Sect Leader is bright
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.88,0:11:41.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,and respectable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:43.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,But after seeing you today,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:45.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sect Leader Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.76,0:11:48.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I see you have become a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:50.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,What does fellow cultivator mean ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.69,0:11:52.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:53.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,400 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.92,0:11:56.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,these mountains were full of spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.32,0:11:57.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,and surrounded by beautiful light.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:00.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,But now they look miserable and exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.96,0:12:03.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I ask Sect Leader,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:07.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,is this related to the Teng Family draining the Spirit Veins ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.55,0:12:08.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:12.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what fellow cultivator means by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.84,0:12:14.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sect Leader,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.00,0:12:16.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's give Teng Gao to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.12,0:12:18.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a great opportunity !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.28,0:12:19.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Indeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.68,0:12:22.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's rid Wufeng Valley of the Teng Family !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.92,0:12:26.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you think I don't want to ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.32,0:12:28.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:30.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,who can beat Teng Nine ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.60,0:12:44.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Interesting... Interesting !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.36,0:12:56.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wufeng Valley and the Teng Family have always been good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:12:58.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator's cultivation is profound
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.68,0:13:01.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,but if you want to wreck havoc in Wufeng Valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:03.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will have to step over our dead bodies !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.36,0:13:08.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who said
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.00,0:13:11.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,that he is going to kill my Teng Family ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.04,0:13:13.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.48,0:13:22.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Teng Nine,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:25.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,please don't hurt the disciples of Wufeng Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.44,0:13:27.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nonsense !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.88,0:13:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Both are Middle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.28,0:13:37.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,but his pressure is stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:39.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this is a Teng Family Core Member ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.88,0:13:42.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,So he was raised using Spirit Veins ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.84,0:13:45.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, it's him !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,He is the one who killed Teng Shan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:51.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,He arrogantly he said he'd kill everyone named Teng in Wufeng Valley !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:54.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,You overestimate yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.95,0:13:57.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Nascent Soul ghosts
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:13:58.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,will use their bodies
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.68,0:14:00.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,to block your sword energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.60,0:14:01.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.55,0:14:02.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,will soon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:05.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,become one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.74,0:14:10.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.05,0:14:32.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is that all you've got ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:36.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.24,0:14:41.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This guy fighting Teng Nine
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:43.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,will win for sure !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:48.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where is he ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:49.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Damn it !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.28,0:14:52.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will capture you and refine you for 1000 years !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:55.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Really ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:15:00.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then taste this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.40,0:15:20.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother, take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.44,0:15:26.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Delicious !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.92,0:15:28.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.99,0:15:29.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:47.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:48.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,This isn't possible !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.08,0:15:50.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Nine came out
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.04,0:15:50.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,and lost !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.16,0:15:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, please spare my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.56,0:15:56.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please spare my life !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.04,0:15:57.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, what do we do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.64,0:16:03.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wufeng Valley was the top sect of Zhao,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:06.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,but the Teng Family oppressed us for hundreds of years
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:07.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,to the point of collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.16,0:16:08.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,But today,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:11.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Nine's blood was spilled on our gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:14.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wufeng Valley will not let the Teng Family go unpunished.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.96,0:16:16.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.32,0:16:19.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,we sever all ties we had with the Teng Family !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.60,0:16:23.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciples of Wufeng Valley, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:25.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I order you to kill the Teng Family members.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:27.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every single one !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.97,0:16:29.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes Sect Leader !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.16,0:17:04.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Two,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.28,0:17:05.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Three,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.32,0:17:06.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Four,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:09.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,lead all cultivators Core Formation and above
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:12.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,and get rid of this murderer immediately !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.02,0:17:14.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who dare to kill our Teng Family
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.49,0:17:16.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.83,0:17:18.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,with their family
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:19.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,and their souls !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.60,0:17:24.28,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1313,501)\fad(300,000)}Wang Zhuo\NWang Lin's cousin\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.01,0:17:38.89,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I've had my share of wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.05,0:17:38.89,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}now I want to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.97,0:17:42.45,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Is my destiny a wall of restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.53,0:17:48.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}that's blocking all my hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.41,0:17:48.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}for life ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.17,0:17:54.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}My flesh and blood witnessed the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.89,0:17:54.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.45,0:17:57.53,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}How do you navigate through the years passing by ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.89,0:18:03.53,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Nirvana and rebirth are no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.61,0:18:03.53,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.89,0:18:09.01,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.93,0:18:09.01,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.29,0:18:13.05,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Renegades
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.05,0:18:13.05,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.05,0:18:16.89,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Don't tell me that I overestimate myself
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.00,0:18:16.89,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and that the path to revenge leads to hell
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.13,0:18:21.01,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}because I don't see the harm in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:28.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}My new body opens its eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.53,0:18:28.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}and awakens from its dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.93,0:18:36.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I have overcome many trials
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.05,0:18:36.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}to get this body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.57,0:18:44.01,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}No matter how many endless dark nights go by,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.61,0:18:44.01,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}I can still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.41,0:18:53.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}By sticking to this thought, I will get it done
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.37,0:18:53.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}by my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.81,0:19:14.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Returning to my body opened my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.53,0:19:14.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I need to continue my Immortal journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.77,0:19:22.33,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}With a flick of a finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:22.33,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}only my indomitable heart remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.37,0:19:31.73,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.33,0:19:31.73,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.97,0:19:39.57,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.49,0:19:39.57,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}like the descent of a god.
